  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lan 104.03 Roster Distribution. Copies of a roster containing names, addresses, and assigned numbers of licensed land surveyors shall be furnished upon request. The fee shall be $10.00.\n\nSource. #7547, eff 8-25-01",
